// SaysList :
"P4228590223" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown> {HeroName}, this is Scirocco.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Zephyr has provided his minions with enhancements he's combined to unstable levels.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>He is channeling his power source into a series of altars that are charging those combined enhancements.  Destroy those altars and you will prevent them from gaining invulnerabilty."
// SaysList :
"P1387602070" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>It was very foolish of Zephyr to provide his minions with his own Enhancements.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>They were indeed items of great power, but such an item is useless in the hands of the inexperienced.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>I will seek where these powers of his comes from.  The connection between him and his belt will be the most obvious start.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>For now, we are done, {HeroName}.  I trust that you are, at this point, capable of achieving victory by your own means."

