// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2120619922" "You survived Zephyr's foolish plan of giving his newly acquired minions significant portions of his power... with the help of Arachnos, of course."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2604359143" "So you survived, did you?  I would have been rather shocked if you hadn't.  Zephyr has shown himself to be a complete idiot, so your success shows that you <b>can</b> fight your way out of a wet paper sack.  Be lucky that I did not authorize any of you the right to attack each other.  As much of an idiot as he may be, he does seem be rather impervious to all forms of damage - allowing him that would have been to have just handed him a victory.  I may not like you, {HeroName}, but I truly like him even less."
// RandomFameString :
"P910803491" "Isn't that the same {HeroName} those Gold Brickers were whining about?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DollfaceOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1025269801" "You may think you were soooooo smart to blow up those Longbows, but I'll have you know that I'm as smart as I am cute!<br><br>We're going to have some fun with getting you in trouble with the police!  Yup!  I'm calling the cops on you!"
// Answer Text :
"P3258701540" "I'm playing the 'hero', Dollface.  Cops don't arrest heroes."
// Page DollfaceOne Text :
"P1403102885" "Yeah, that's what you think, huh?  Well, {Hero.gender=Male Mr.|Ms.} Smartypants, what if they think you're a bad {Hero.gender=Male man|lady}, huh?  Then you're going to go to JAIL!"
// Answer Text :
"P2279907376" "What're you gonna do, mind-control them?"
// Page DollfaceTwo Text :
"P207657100" "HEY!  WHO TOLD YOU!?  Did that silly doctor tell you!?<br><br>Great.  My plan is so ruined now.  I spent all that time putting a mental time-bomb in your head, and for what?  For you to go ahead and ruin it?  THANKS A LOT, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P2577673194" "Wait, what?!  What do you mean 'mental' time-bomb!?"
// Page DollfaceThree Text :
"P1093369116" "The thing that's going to make your brain blow up in the next hour.  Or was it day?  I'm so upset with you I don't even remember anymore!<br><br>You were SUPPOSED to go fight some Arachnos guys to get the deactivator safety-word and then bring it to Dean Yu at the University so he could remove the mental bomb, but you screwed it all up!"
// Answer Text :
"P2888159127" "So I need to get this 'word' to John Yu?"
// Page DilloDone Text :
"P3737491165" "Yeah, but I wasn't going to tell you that Dean Yu could fix it, because then you could fix the bomb.  You were supposed to fight Arachnos guys then get put in jail forever.<br><br>Whatever.  I don't like playing with you, {HeroName}.  You ruin everything!"
// Answer Text :
"P2946801297" "Arachnos agents then Dean Yu.  Got it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeanYu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3604652741" "What is the meaning of this?  If I plan on receiving the grant money from these inventions people are putting together, I'm going to need to publish these papers in prestigious journals before they do.<br><br>I would hope the reason you're bothering me is far more important than that."
// Answer Text :
"P3297794386" "I've got a mental time-bomb in my head!"
// Page GrymOne Text :
"P1451967343" "Mental time-bomb?  I've seen a number of people here invent all manner of devices from the salvage they've acquired through fighting the scum that litters the streets, but I've never heard of a 'mental time-bomb' before."
// Answer Text :
"P2622218854" "I have the deactivation phrase right here!"
// Page SteelTwo Text :
"P970296795" "Deactivation phrase?  What on earth are you blabbering on about?  Let me see this.<br><br><color orange>John Yu looks at the paper, a smile curling around the edges of his mouth, then looks very stone-faced a moment later.</color><br><br>Well, this is very serious, indeed.  This phrase - 'ego sum res fraudatio' - definitely has the ability to remove the common, every day mental time-bomb. You see, it's Neo-Latin for - 'Better than a faker.'  This was the old way of saying - 'Haters gotta hate'.<br><br>However, this will not help with a mental time-bomb in the head of one of you super-powered types.  No, no, you'll need more than that."
// Answer Text :
"P4055723468" "Hurry!  My head could blow at any moment!"
// Page SteelThree Text :
"P2599128388" "In order for you to deactivate it, you will need to think of the phrase - 'ego sum res fraudatio' - whilst you dispatch a good number of Luddites that have been making my job very difficult as of late.<br><br>Oh! And, of course, they've been interfering with mental deactivationizing... I think I heard a group down south in the Devil's Coat Tails talking about just that!<br><br>So, go knock around a number of those Luddites and you should be right as rain."
// Answer Text :
"P2139611225" "Whew!  Thanks!  I might actually live another day!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1710460032" "You are required to submit yourself before Dollface and endure through her 'dastardly' scheme.  So far you have managed to foil Zephyr's foolish plan, which isn't saying much.  I am unaware of what her plan will entail, but I doubt it's pleasant."
// AcceptString :
"P335682729" "I'll handle Dollface like I did Zephyr."
// SendOffString :
"P22668360" "You would do well to know that your arrogance, no matter how far it has brought you thus far, will likely be the cause of your ultimate failure.  Dollface has been given special privileges by our patron, so do not be surprised if there is more than meets the eye to her personal plan.  Now go.  She awaits you."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P843151297" "<color deepskyblue>Dollface's Devices</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3872695141" "Talk to Dollface"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3293056501" "Dollface is still waiting for you.  Failing to submit to her test will result in your forfeiture in the tournament."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P821022295" "Dollface claims there is a 'mental time-bomb' in your head.  You're going to need to beat down some Arachnos agents to get the deactivation code-phrase if you want to live."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1913736984" "Defeat an Arachnos Patrol in Port Oakes!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P93287070" "Well, well.  It would seem that you have very time-sensitive matter, {HeroName}.  Perhaps you may want to take care of that, hm?"
// VillainDescription :
"P4034966694" "Defeat {Remain} Arachnos agents"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P3594564945" "Defeat one last Arachnos agent"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1852837902" "You found the code phrase on the last agent.  He had a very far-away, glazed look in his eyes which tells you this was the one Dollface had beguiled."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1356182239" "Travel to Cap au Diable via Ferry"
// VolumeDescription :
"P3906367945" "Go to the University in Cap au Diable"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P513616383" "You've made it the Ferry station.  It doesn't look like you have much time left.  You had better get to that University pronto!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2279040083" "Talk to Dean Yu at the University"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3755516981" "You talked with Dean Yu.  In order for him to help you, you're going to need to dispatch a number of Luddite that have been bothering him as of late."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P195426225" "Dispatch Luddites in the Devil's Coat Tails Neighborhood"
// VillainDescription :
"P1446288624" "Defeat {Remain} Luddites"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P2958010023" "One last Luddite remains"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P36358989" "You have done away with the number of Luddites needed to turn off the mental time-bomb.  It looks like you're finally safe!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P986401353" "Congratulations on your stunning victory over Dollface's heinous plan.  I was quite worried that your head was going to blow up at any moment, possibly causing an explosion rivaling that of your ego.<br><br>The pride you've earned for beating her at her own tricks, is well, stupendous indeed."
// RandomFameString :
"P954362030" "You know, I really hate that {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Crosscut 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P544735257" "What a lovely look, {HeroName}.  Green is definitely your color."
// Answer Text :
"P333934162" "Get to the point, Crosscut."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P916564378" "Oh, but that's when my friends no longer sing those adorable warbles of 'please don't' and 'I'll do anything for you to stop'.  But, if you'd like, I'll do that for you... since you're one of my favorites.<br><br>Today we're going to play a little game I like to call 'Hide and Seek'.  I've drizzled a rather delicate perfume all over you with a blend of notes such as mahogany, rose hips, and orphan's tears.  You may not have a nose for the aroma, but it soothes the savage snake."
// Answer Text :
"P506918189" "Your evil plan is to spray me with perfume?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P631296298" "No, that was just something I felt would make you happy, {HeroName}.  You are happy now, aren't you?  Tell me... tell me I make you happy...<br><br>Since you are the silly hero in my game, all you need to do is use the little vial of antivenin that I have in the back of these caves.  See?  How devilishly frightening, yes?"
// Answer Text :
"P2132724022" "Why is antivenin supposed to be scary?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2510196907" "You silly little hero, you.  How else are you supposed to live through the venom coursing through your veins?"
// Answer Text :
"P1696237978" "Venom?  What venom?!"
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P2083039045" "The kissy-juice my snake friends just injected you with before you talked with me, of course.<br><br>Shush shush... you can thank me later, {HeroName}.  Why not after you find the antivenin, yes?<br><br>You don't mind if I tag along and watch, do you?<br><br>I like to watch."
// Answer Text :
"P4157949046" "How dare... forget it... I'll deal with you later!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3126923342" "With your resounding triumph over Dollface's plan, you will now move onto Crosscut's personal project.  I'm quite certain your cunning and expert intelligence will surely allow you to bypass whatever simple plan Crosscut has in store for you, yes?"
// AcceptString :
"P1932702644" "I'm sure I can handle whatever he can dish out."
// SendOffString :
"P642640670" "I'm quite certain he believes the same.  You should be able to make it through this by the skin of your teeth.  Do not tarry, for he's waiting for you as we speak.<br><br>Oh, another thing, {HeroName}.  Good luck.  You'll need it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1937458276" "Endure Crosscut's Plan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P618612653" "We are eagerly waiting for you to engage in Crosscut's trial, {HeroName}.  The anticipation is gut-wrenching."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P750840777" "<color deepskyblue>Crosscut's Test</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3801426186" "From the tracks of dark stains leading from the entryway to these caves, you're pretty certain this is where Crosscut will be found."

