"P1239022769" "Congratulations, {HeroName}!  You found it!<em t=6>Oh, goodness... it seems I'm such a sillyhead.  I filled the jar with a pheromone to make the snakes hate you.<em t=6> Ah.. yes... I gave the antivenin to the Snake Matriarch. I'm sure she'll give it to you willingly.<em t=6>I'd forget my own head next if it weren't sewn on."
