"P1308008406" "I'm just all over the place, aren't I?  It was the daughter I gave the antivenin to, now that I think of it, not the mother.<em t=6>I remember now... the 'hero' was supposed to kill the mother in front of the daughter.  Yes... that was it."
// SaysList :
"P632183842" "Well, that was not as fun as doing it myself.  Next time I won't share.<em t=6>Goodbye, {HeroName}."

