// Dialog :
"P961803043" "I have assessed the details of what Crosscut put the hero, you, through.  Although you survived, it would appear as if Crosscut's plan succeeded as he had planned.   This round goes to Crosscut.  Do not frown, {HeroName}.  You are still ahead for now... until our final event, that is."
// RandomFameString :
"P3926503511" "What the heck is that smell?  It's like the stink of a snake den.  Is it coming from {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Omnicore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1503963353" "How??!!  How could they turn on me?!  I made them in my image, and they turned on me..."
// Answer Text :
"P2670031546" "It seems you fail at being a god, Omnicore."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1580136091" "YOU!!!  YOU ARE RESPONSIBLE FOR THIS!!!<br><br>I don't know how you did, but youuuuu... YOU DID THIS!  I VOW TO ---"
// Answer Text :
"P2669594181" "To keep failing at beating me?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3169412878" "Mark my words, {HeroName}.  I.  Will.  Kill.  You."
// Answer Text :
"P1114921669" "It's good to have goals, Omnicore."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2389492019" "It's a shame you made it through Crosscut's ordeal.  I expected far more from him.  Quite literally, I was expecting far, far more.  However, what's done is done.  I doubt you will make it through this final ordeal, though.  You see, Omnicore was quite delighted to hear that you would be playing the role of 'hero' in her upcoming plan.  This should prove to be most entertaining."
// AcceptString :
"P617551859" "I've beat the rest, I'll beat her."
// SendOffString :
"P3580631556" "Oh, we'll see about that, won't we?  You know the procedure.  Meet her at the specified location.  I'm sure she'll be waiting with bells on."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2303630958" "Endure Omnicore's Master Plan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P471087234" "What are you waiting for?  Overdrive is waiting to commence her final test."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3872465487" "<color deepskyblue>Omnicore's Toys</color>"

