// SaysList :
"P3374625971" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Welcome to my parlor, {HeroName}.  I've been looking forward to this moment ever since we first met.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Since I do not care to waste any more time on you than needed, I'll explain what is to happen.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>You, as the hero, are my captive.  I am offering you a means of escaping.  All you need to do is defeat all of my robot minions that are programmed to kill you.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Simple enough to understand, yes?  Then start fighting and show our kindly patron how pathetic you truly are."
// SaysList :
"P3188751244" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>You believe that was all there was, {HeroName}?<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>You are in my own personal base, you fool.  In <b>my</b> lair, I am your lord and master.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>You have defeated my robotic clockwork minion, but you will not defeat my recreation of the demon-worshipping Hellions.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>And when I am done with you, I will use your body to house my next robotic creation, do you hear me?!.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>...shielded from outside..."
// SaysList :
"P2146007301" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Once, I was simple.  I wanted simple things.  Money.  Riches.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Then I tasted power, {HeroName}.  And with power came everything else.  Most people share their living quarters with others, banding together as a group.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>I REFUSE TO!  This base is mine, and mine alone.  And when I take my place at our patron's side, this base will pale in comparison to the one I will possess then.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>There is more for you to fight, you sickening excuse for a 'hero'.  Fight or DIE!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>...off the jamming signal...<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>...help from Arachnos..."
// SaysList :
"P2280948475" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>You have done well so far, {HeroName}.  These simple robots had better not stop you.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Omnicore is not to be trusted, however.  I shall divine what she has in store for you.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>What's the matter, {HeroName}?  Has your fear finally overcome you?<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Do you bow to my omnipotence?  Perhaps I shall let you join my supergroup when this is done.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>I shall consider it after I see what you can do with my next minions!"
// SaysList :
"P2400414439" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>HAHAHAHA!  Did you think I would let some powerless worm such as you join me?<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>You fool!  You are nothing compared to my might and intellect.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Even though you are facing my robotic creations, I have far more in store for you!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Go, {HeroName}!  Face my next creation and continue to use up your powers!"
// SaysList :
"P2387341898" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>And now it is time, {HeroName}.  You will now face the real challenge, now that you are weakend and tired from fighting all of these old models.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Come to me and face my new creations!  Stolen from another world and perfected by ME!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>I will relish the look on your face when --- <t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>Do as I command, minions!  Annihilate, {HeroName}!  I said, 'ANNIHILATE {HERONAME}!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor deepskyblue>No!  What are you doing?!  DO AS I COMMA ---<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Omnicore is in violation of forbidden technology.  Learn from her lesson, {HeroName}.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>What Arachnos gives, Arachnos can as easily remove."

