// SaysList :
"P3871572478" "<t 4><t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown> {HeroName}. It appears that Dr. Graves has prepared you for an unavoidable defeat.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>All of the other contestants arrived in Galaxy City long before you were informed of this next phase of the contest.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>To counter this, I have ordered distress beacons be placed in key locations in the city.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>If you make use of them, you should be able to defeat some of Paragon's heroes, and you should gain an insurmountable advantage."

